Prune flate's persistent cache

Usage:
  flate cache [flags]
  flate cache [command]

Available Commands:
  gc          Prune stale cache tags and unused Git generations

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for cache

Global Flags:
      --log-level string   Set log level: debug,info,warn,error [env: FLATE_LOG_LEVEL] (default "error")
      --no-progress        Hide live progress on stderr [env: FLATE_NO_PROGRESS]

Use "flate cache [command] --help" for more information about a command.
